This is the EF Core "bridge" between your C# classes and the database. The OnModelCreating method adds unique
indexes that enforce business rules at the database level:

Unique Email per Participant/Organiser → no duplicate accounts.

Unique (EventId, ParticipantId) on EventEnrolment → participants can't enrol twice in the same event.

1-to-1 EventEnrolment ↔ Result → matches your ERD cardinality.
